  "dmNarration": [
    "The party arrives in Phandalin with Sildar free, recovered supplies and an unresolved search for Gundren. Klarg withdrew after the mock negotiation; Yeemik holds the cave. No delivery payment or rest has happened yet.",
    "Inside Barthen’s shop, coils of rope, trail rations and ordinary tools fill the shelves. Barthen looks up: ‘You’re the escort Gundren hired? Where is he?’ You can settle the delivery, ask about missing people, seek lodging or follow another town lead.",
    "Outside, locals lower their voices when scarlet-cloaked men pass. A witness says the Redbrands took a dwarf matching Gundren’s description beneath the ruined manor. The witness does not know what happened afterward. Sildar wants his missing contact Iarno investigated. The manor has ordinary access and a possible alternate entrance if you investigate. Prisoners and bargaining are possible; this is not a mandatory room-clearing mission."
  ],
